license: "MIT"
abstract: "Interactive digital-humanities web atlas (React 19 + TypeScript + Vite) tracing how 188 everyday Chinese words evolve, retain, and contest meanings across centuries through dated historical corpus citations, 12 classic school textbook works, and A/B/C evidence grades."
